": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/50", "parent": "#/body", "page": 4, "bbox": [72.0, 677.7, 498.3, 702.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "The timetable you submitted on December 10, 2024, states that you will conduct this study according to the following schedule:", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["POSTMARKETING COMMITMENTS NOT SUBJECT TO THE REPORTING REQUIREMENTS UNDER SECTION 506B"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/51", "parent": "#/groups/5", "page": 4, "bbox": [144.0, 650.1, 318.1, 661.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Final report submission: 03/2025", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["POSTMARKETING COMMITMENTS NOT SUBJECT TO THE REPORTING REQUIREMENTS UNDER SECTION 506B"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/52", "parent": "#/body", "page": 4, "bbox": [72.0, 511.7, 538.8, 633.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Submit chemistry, manufacturing, and controls postmarketing final reports to this BLA. In addition, under 21 CFR 601.70 you should include a status summary of each commitment in your annual progress report of postmarketing studies to this BLA. The status summary should include expected summary completion and final report submission dates, any changes in plans since the last annual report, and, for clinical studies/trials, number of patients/subjects entered into each study/trial. All submissions, including supplements, relating to these postmarketing commitments should be prominently labeled \"Postmarketing Commitment Protocol,\" \"Postmarketing Commitment Final Report,\" or \"Postmarketing Commitment Correspondence.\"", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["POSTMARKETING COMMITMENTS NOT SUBJECT TO THE REPORTING REQUIREMENTS UNDER SECTION 506B"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/53", "parent": "#/body", "page": 4, "bbox": [72.0, 484.1, 243.3, 495.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "REPORTING REQUIREMENTS", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/54", "parent": "#/body", "page": 4, "bbox": [72.0, 443.1, 531.4, 468.1], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "We remind you that you must comply with reporting requirements for an approved BLA (in 21 CFR 600.80 and in 21 CFR 600.81).", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/55", "parent": "#/body", "page": 4, "bbox": [72.0, 401.7, 526.1, 426.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "If you have any questions, email H. F. Van Horn III, PharmD, MBA, Senior Regulatory Project Manager, at Howard.VanHornIII@fda.hhs.gov.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/56", "parent": "#/body", "page": 4, "bbox": [265.5, 374.1, 318.2, 385.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Sincerely,", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/57", "parent": "#/body", "page": 4, "bbox": [265.5, 346.3, 489.0, 357.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "{See appended electron